WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.502
-My first guest tonight is a
talented and hardworking actor.

00:00:03.502 --> 00:00:07.006
He stars in the show "See"
on Apple TV+.

00:00:07.006 --> 00:00:09.475
Here is Jason Momoa!

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:11.477
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:12.945
That's my man! Ahh!

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:15.348
Ah, I've missed ya.
I love you, buddy.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:17.450
It's so good to see you!

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.986
-I love you! I love you, Jimmy.
I'm sorry I'm not there, bud.

00:00:19.986 --> 00:00:21.954
-No, please.
Anything. I understand.

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:24.290
Next time -- Next time, I want
to see you in person, pal.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.225
You look great.

00:00:26.225 --> 00:00:28.194
That's exactly what you want
Jason Momoa to look like.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:31.831
Am I wrong? You are a stud.
Look at you. Look at you, bud.

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:33.733
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.167
I love it! I love the set.
I love the hair.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:38.772
Would you ever
cut your hair short?

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:40.139
-Hell no.

00:00:40.139 --> 00:00:43.176
-Yeah. Never, right?
No. Have you ever?

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:46.446
-I mean, I'm not a big fan of
haircuts or cutting anything.

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:48.481
My beard or -- I'm -- Yeah.

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.149
-Yeah, just grow it
all the way out.

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:52.084
-Well, you know,
most of the roles I play --

00:00:52.084 --> 00:00:53.886
Like, "See,"
I've got to have long hair.

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:55.421
"Aquaman," I've got to
have long hair.

00:00:55.421 --> 00:00:58.157
So until I need to play
that role, I'll wait.

00:00:58.157 --> 00:01:01.160
-Yeah. Would your wife be cool
with you if you cut your hair?

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.228
-Probably not.

00:01:03.228 --> 00:01:05.932
-I wanted to talk
to you about --

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:08.801
I know Justice League,
the Snyder cut,

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:11.771
the director's cut
came out during quarantine.

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:15.008
Four hours, by the way.
I loved it.

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:16.709
-I thought it was fantastic.

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:19.779
I was going to ask you.
What did you think of it?

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:21.847
-I mean, listen, I love Zack.

00:01:21.847 --> 00:01:23.483
And that's kind of
what I signed up for,

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:27.253
whatever, eight years ago,
is to have his vision.

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:31.457
And, you know, the cool thing
about that four-hour piece

00:01:31.457 --> 00:01:33.226
is that I didn't reshoot
anything.

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:34.694
Like, that was all there.
-Really?

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:37.129
-So it's interesting when people
come up to me and they're like,

00:01:37.129 --> 00:01:38.898
"Oh, I really love this,
and it was so detailed,

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:40.233
and it explained so much."

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:41.634
I'm like, "Yeah,
that's what we went and shot."

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.436
I didn't have to redo anything.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:46.105
So, you know, because
of the tragedy and, you know --

00:01:46.105 --> 00:01:49.008
I'm happy we made one,
but I'm really happy

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:52.979
that we got to release his art,
and a lot of fans are happy.

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:54.547
-Yes.

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:56.115
-And the truth of it is,
I like the four hours.

00:01:56.115 --> 00:01:57.717
And normally we watch shows
that are, you know --

00:01:57.717 --> 00:01:59.919
It's just a four-part series.

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:01.754
So, I like the extended

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:03.356
and spending time
with the characters, so...

00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:05.658
-Well, Aquaman
made another appearance

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:08.460
this year on Instagram.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:11.564
Dwayne Johnson. Do you know
what I'm talking about?

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:13.265
-Oh, yeah.

00:02:13.265 --> 00:02:15.101
-Yeah, Dwayne asked you to
make a video for his daughter,

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:16.903
'cause his daughter loves you.

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:20.439
My kids love you, too.
My whole family loves you.

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:23.476
We're just big Jason Momoa fans.
But we have a clip of it.

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:26.913
Here's Jason Momoa's birthday
message to Dwayne's daughter.

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:30.416
-I'm sorry I couldn't be there.
But I love you.

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:35.187
And tell your papa
that I love him, too.

00:02:35.187 --> 00:02:36.489
Happy third birthday.

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:40.126
-Yay!
-Yay!

00:02:40.126 --> 00:02:42.128
-Yeah.

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:44.097
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:45.998
That's so cute. But I love that.

00:02:45.998 --> 00:02:47.767
He asked her -- He's like,

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:49.235
"Who is cooler --
Daddy or Aquaman?"

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:50.803
And she didn't even think
for a second.

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:52.838
She goes, "Aquaman."
That's so funny.

00:02:52.838 --> 00:02:56.109
Do you know Dwayne for a while?
-Yeah.

00:02:56.109 --> 00:02:58.744
I met him, gosh,
almost 20 years ago.

00:02:58.744 --> 00:03:00.379
We were in Hawaii when we met,

00:03:00.379 --> 00:03:02.448
and we have
a very close friend, who --

00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:05.552
You know, we kind of met through
that and stay in touch.

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:08.154
And we've tried to get together
and make a movie together.

00:03:08.154 --> 00:03:10.857
It's just he's way busier
than I am,

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:13.759
and I'm pretty busy right now,
so one of these days...

00:03:13.759 --> 00:03:15.895
-You have to make a movie
together. You have to.

00:03:15.895 --> 00:03:17.429
-We will,
and it's really cool now,

00:03:17.429 --> 00:03:18.931
because he's kind of
in my pocket.

00:03:18.931 --> 00:03:20.433
So I can call him up
and be like, "Yo."

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:21.935
I got him.
-You owe me a favor." Yeah.

00:03:21.935 --> 00:03:24.136
"I did the birthday message.
Now you've got to do a movie."

00:03:24.136 --> 00:03:26.005
Exactly. Yeah.

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:28.641
Before we talk about "See,"
I wanted to quickly mention

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:29.942
another project you're doing.

00:03:29.942 --> 00:03:32.311
You're involved
in the new "Dune."

00:03:32.311 --> 00:03:34.446
That is going to be giant,
buddy.

00:03:34.446 --> 00:03:36.816
-It is a masterpiece.

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:41.087
It is -- I've never been in
anything, like, on that scope.

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:44.623
Denis is a genius.
And I got to see it.

00:03:44.623 --> 00:03:47.126
It was really cool 'cause
my kids were up here,

00:03:47.126 --> 00:03:48.995
and so we got to
take them to it.

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:50.863
It's the first time
I got to see something like that

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:55.701
with my kids. It's a very
adult movie, but so beautiful.

00:03:55.701 --> 00:03:58.537
-Yeah.
-The cast is massive.

00:03:58.537 --> 00:04:00.306
-Yeah, oh, it's heavy hitters.
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:02.675
That comes out --
Come back for that, too.

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:06.779
That comes out on October 1st
in theaters and on HBO Max.

00:04:06.779 --> 00:04:08.414
But now I want to talk
about "See"

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:10.249
because this is fantastic.

00:04:10.249 --> 00:04:14.354
It's on Apple TV+ and
just renewed for season two.

00:04:14.354 --> 00:04:17.222
But then I just heard today

00:04:17.222 --> 00:04:19.625
it got renewed
for season three, as well.

00:04:19.625 --> 00:04:21.394
So congrats, bud! Dude.

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:23.029
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:23.029 --> 00:04:24.663
-It's huge news. It's huge news.

00:04:24.663 --> 00:04:26.699
Because it's literally the --

00:04:26.699 --> 00:04:30.169
It's probably the hardest
and greatest character

00:04:30.169 --> 00:04:32.104
I've ever played
just in the sense of, you know,

00:04:32.104 --> 00:04:34.540
the whole world is blind.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.442
-Yeah.
-It's just very challenging.

00:04:36.442 --> 00:04:39.712
And I love the cast.
I love the crew, the world.

00:04:39.712 --> 00:04:42.915
And it's tough.
If I'm not fighting, I'm crying.

00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:44.884
And just -- It's pushed me
on so many levels.

00:04:44.884 --> 00:04:48.054
-Yeah, you're right.
But that's kind of --

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:51.991
That's kind of what I think
about you when I think of you

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:53.759
in general.
I mean, you're a big dude.

00:04:53.759 --> 00:04:55.761
You're an actor.
I mean, you're a tough guy.

00:04:55.761 --> 00:04:57.497
But, also, you're a family guy,

00:04:57.497 --> 00:05:00.400
and you're one of the
nicest guys I've ever met.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.034
And so I like
watching you do this.

00:05:02.034 --> 00:05:05.438
Because you get to fight people
and, you know, crush people,

00:05:05.438 --> 00:05:07.606
and then you also
get to love your kids.

00:05:07.606 --> 00:05:08.975
And it's like -- Yeah.

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:10.676
-Yeah, it's a man trying
to keep his family together.

00:05:10.676 --> 00:05:12.444
It's beautiful
and it's emotional,

00:05:12.444 --> 00:05:14.781
and I love the journey,
so I'm really excited

00:05:14.781 --> 00:05:17.182
to do another season
with everybody, and so --

00:05:17.182 --> 00:05:18.551
Yeah.
-Here we go.

00:05:18.551 --> 00:05:22.555
I want to show everyone a clip
of season two of "See."

00:05:22.555 --> 00:05:24.856
Check it out.

00:05:24.856 --> 00:05:27.126
-Good morning, Baba Voss.

00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:31.597
♪♪

00:05:31.597 --> 00:05:34.400
-It's been a long time, brother.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.369
♪♪

00:05:36.369 --> 00:05:37.903
[ Crowd shouting ]

00:05:37.903 --> 00:05:40.639
♪♪

00:05:40.639 --> 00:05:42.842
-I swore I would never
return here.

00:05:42.842 --> 00:05:47.580
♪♪

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.415
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:49.415 --> 00:05:52.919
-Yeah, buddy!
Jason Momoa, everybody!

